# Torronto Web config. Copy to web.env (gitignored) and adjust.
BIND=0.0.0.0
PORT=8080
MODE=manual

# --- Smart plug (Tuya / Smart Life power meter) ---------------------------
# Reads the tub's smart plug over the Tuya cloud. Requires a one-time QR
# login (Smart Life app -> "+ -> Scan" -> Confirm) that writes
# ./tuya.session.json (gitignored). See plug.py.
#
# TUYA_DEVICE_ID      # plug device id (left blank: auto-pick TUYA_DEVICE_NAME)
# TUYA_DEVICE_NAME=Tub mains
# TUYA_SESSION=/path/to/tuya.session.json   # default: ./tuya.session.json
# PLUG_POLL=30         # plug poll cadence in seconds (default 30)
#
# Telegram alerts when a plug relay toggles on/off are OFF unless enabled:
#   PLUG_NOTIFY=1
# When enabled, a change must hold for two consecutive polls and respect
# PLUG_NOTIFY_COOLDOWN (seconds, default 600) so flaky cloud reads can't spam.